例如重排后字段变化、增删键与混合类型键的对齐差异报告形如：

```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "outcome": "different",
  "differences": { "status": false, "body": true },
  "bodyDifferences": [
    { "pointer": "/list/1/v", "planned": 2, "actual": 20 },
    { "pointer": "/list/2", "planned": { "id": "c", "v": 3 }, "actual": "missing", "key": { "field": "id", "value": "c" }, "plannedExists": true, "actualExists": false },
    { "pointer": "/list/0", "planned": "missing", "actual": { "id": true, "v": 4 }, "key": { "field": "id", "value": true }, "plannedExists": false, "actualExists": true }
  ],
  "planned": { "status": 200, "body": { "encoding": "utf-8", "content": "{\"list\":[{\"id\":\"a\",\"v\":1},{\"id\":\"c\",\"v\":3},{\"id\":\"b\",\"v\":2}]}" } },
  "response": { "status": 200, "body": { "encoding": "utf-8", "content": "{\"list\":[{\"id\":true,\"v\":4},{\"id\":\"b\",\"v\":20},{\"id\":\"a\",\"v\":1}]}" } }
}
```

上例中：计划顺序 `a,c,b`、实际顺序 `true(新键),b,a`；`id:"b"` 元素重排后其字段 `v` 由 2 变为 20，内部差异指针取**实际**位置 `/list/1/v`；计划独有的 `id:"c"` 整元素报告在计划位置 `/list/2`（`actualExists:false`）；实际独有的 `id:true` 新键报告在实际位置 `/list/0`（`plannedExists:false`），即便它恰好落在其他计划下标的忽略范围也不会被遮蔽。未配置对齐的普通数组仍像下例那样在原下标报告：

```json
{
  "id": 2,
  "outcome": "different",
  "differences": { "status": false, "body": true },
  "bodyDifferences": [
    { "pointer": "/items/2", "planned": { "id": 3 }, "actual": "missing" },
    { "pointer": "/state", "planned": "paid", "actual": "created" }
  ],
  "planned": { "status": 200, "body": { "encoding": "utf-8", "content": "{\"state\":\"paid\",\"items\":[1,2,{\"id\":3}]}" } },
  "response": { "status": 200, "body": { "encoding": "utf-8", "content": "{\"items\":[1,2],\"state\":\"created\"}" } }

